  "title": "Blueberry Bake",
  "description": "This is a sweet blueberry cobbler that is low in fat and sugar. There &#39;s just a smidgen of white sugar and honey, and the biscuit topping is made with low-fat buttermilk and whole wheat flour. This recipe yields six delicious servings.",
  "authors": [
    "Robyn Webb"
  ],
  "date_published": "2000-01-04T19:44:09-05:00",
  "date_modified": "2022-08-22T14:48:26-04:00",
